<?xpacket begin="ï»¿" id="W5M0MpCehiHzreSzNTczkc9d"?>
<x:xmpmeta xmlns:x="adobe:ns:meta/">
  <rdf:RDF xmlns:rdf="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#">
    <rdf:Description xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/" rdf:about="">
      <dc:title>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">the same old ground</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:title>
      <dc:description>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;"On a day like this, it wasn't even the familiar haunts that Adora craved most. It was the person who had always made it glow with life, her unmistakable mirth disguised behind years of mock scorn and sarcasm. They wanted her rakish attitude, her dauntless drive to take on the world and take no prisoners along the way. It was infectious, her courage in the face of their drifting, incorrigible circumstances and Adora wanted to drink from that fountain everyday. They wanted to sit under that vine and fig tree forever and the ring they'd brought along this evening, nestled into their jacket pocket like a rabbit in hibernation, was meant to be the seed that brought promise of that even brighter spring."&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;-&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;From quick friends to lovers to breaking apart as their paths diverge, Adora and Catra have never been far from each other's side, with a million memories shared over a familiar table and a milkshake. But to everything there is a season, and winter is settling in, making Adora question if they'll ever make it to spring - as friends, as lovers, or as total strangers.&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:description>
      <dc:creator>
        <rdf:Seq>
          <rdf:li>BabelFishing</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Seq>
      </dc:creator>
      <dc:subject>
        <rdf:Bag>
          <rdf:li>Fanworks</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Teen And Up Audiences</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>She-Ra and the Princesses of Power (2018)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Adora/Catra (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Adora (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Catra</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Shadow Weaver | Light Spinner (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Sea Hawk (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Kyle (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Fluff</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Angst</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Hurt/Comfort</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Friends to Lovers</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Mutual Pining</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Happy Ending</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Sports</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>First Kiss</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Marriage Proposal</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Childhood Memories</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Break Up</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>College</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Drinking</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Alternate Universe - Real World</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Nonbinary Adora (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Shadow Weaver | Light Spinner's A+ Parenting</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>I really made Shadow Weaver the worst mom huh</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>how'd that happen</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>F/F</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>No Archive Warnings Apply</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Transphobia (Mentioned)</rdf:li>
